{"id":"1242115703531454464","identityId":"1239724074505539584","name":"漂泊者-男-湮灭","displayName":"漂泊者 · 男","romanizedName":"ROVER","description":"身世不明的共鸣者，拥有吸收一切声音的力量。 为了寻回记忆而踏上旅途。","resonanceName":"声之容器","gender":"男","origin":"未知","identity":"","affiliation":"","specialty":"","weapon":"迅刀","element":"湮灭","releaseVersion":"","cv":{},"avatar":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/newHead/aki/man.png","width":500,"height":500,"fallbackUrl":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/c3e3365e6e6c4d09911fbcc7d90307f120251118.png"},"hero":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/10ebeddd2cfe4a54a8dcd673832ed49920240521.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},"poster":null,"artworks":[{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/5f2d5b70b7ef43f4aff481632fbc322420240521.png","label":"立绘","kind":"portrait","orientation":"desktop","width":719,"height":713},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/10ebeddd2cfe4a54a8dcd673832ed49920240521.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/b5371777afbd439abc72bd563c701a2f20240521.png","label":"编队立绘 · 移动版","kind":"team","orientation":"mobile","width":1129,"height":1654}],"archives":[{"id":"1242115703531454464-lore-9-0","title":"检验鉴定","html":"<p><span><span><strong>未知</strong></span></span></p>","images":[]}],"treasures":[{"id":"1242115703531454464-lore-10-0","title":"未知","html":"<p><span><strong>未知</strong></span></p>","images":[]}],"stories":[],"outfits":[],"voices":[{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173188937191424","title":"闲趣1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090135622316.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173189753888768","title":"闲趣2","text":"它是我与这世界的连结，见证我所经历的一切。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090314703714.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173190052077568","title":"闲趣3","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749090377182837.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173090802262016","title":"入队1","text":"路途还很遥远，继续前进吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066739819890.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173090611159040","title":"入队2","text":"新的发现吗？","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066713146671.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173091213303808","title":"入队3","text":"我想留在大家身边……从过去，一同迈向明天。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749066787368942.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173157349888000","title":"突破1","text":"世界……似乎变得更加清晰。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749082607429354.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173159387521024","title":"突破2","text":"这股力量虽有些不可思议，却让我感到十分的安心。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083088264535.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173159663951872","title":"突破3","text":"我还需要更多的时间去了解、熟悉这陌生的世界。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083151751347.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173162332721152","title":"突破4","text":"又是新的旅途吗？新的声音，新的故事，还有……碎片般的记忆。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083765602327.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-11-0-1324173162096648192","title":"突破5","text":"陆止于此，海始于斯，我们的旅途还远未结束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749083720777613.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324178221222223872","title":"重击1","text":"揭开帷幕。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735750289880301037.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324178221224189952","title":"重击2","text":"就此消失！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735750289892902707.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027667238912","title":"共鸣技能1","text":"破！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051718854414.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027430522880","title":"共鸣技能2","text":"消散吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051648437669.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027741700096","title":"共鸣技能3","text":"声形回束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051722498330.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027740508160","title":"共鸣技能4","text":"破绽百出。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051731900579.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027652820992","title":"共鸣技能5","text":"不要犹豫。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051705211665.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324173027703951360","title":"共鸣技能6","text":"和光尘影。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735749051715992586.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242115703531454464-voice-12-0-1324178221178445824","title":"共鸣技能7","text":"随影而来。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1735750289875516013.wav","language":"中文","cv":"马洋","category":"combat"},{"id":"12